> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.18</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἃ μηδ' ὄ. ἤλπισαν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">19.275</span> </span>: hence freq. opp. <span class=\"gk\">ὕπαρ,</span> v. ὕπαρ <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">κατ' ὄναρ</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">in a dream,</b> condemned by <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Phryn.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">395</span> </span>, but quoted by him from Polemo, is also found in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ev.Matt.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1.20</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aristid.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Or.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">47(23).21</span> </span>: with sense, <b class=\"lex-tr\">in consequence of a dream,</b> in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">SIG</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1147</span> </span> (Crete, <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">ii/iii A. D.</span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Supp.Epigr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.405</span> </span> (Macedonia).</div></div>"}